<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia November unemployment stable at 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia November unemployment stable at 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 Nov	  Oct	  Nov 95</p>
<p>    Percentage			14.0	 14.0	  14.4</p>
<p>    Total			  121,831    120,722	125,611 --</p>
<p>Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
